{"title":"Tariff sentences to ponder","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/916327829/0/marginalrevolution~Tariff-sentences-to-ponder.html","date":1744050608000,"content":"<blockquote><p>We find that only 15.1 percent of the decline in goods-sector employment from 1992 to 2012 stems from U.S. trade deficits; most of the decline is due to differential productivity growth.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://users.econ.umn.edu/~tkehoe/papers/SavingGlut.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">the full paper</a> by Kehoe, Ruhl, and Steinberg, via <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/ZMazlish\" target=\"_blank\">Zack Mazlish</a>.  I believe we have covered this issue before.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/sentences-to-ponder-128.html\">Tariff sentences to ponder</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/916327829/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/916327829/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/916327829/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/916327829/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/916327829/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/916327829/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a hre